WEBVTT

00:35.785 --> 00:37.120
If I do not mind dying,

00:38.079 --> 00:39.914
then can I keep doing
what I have been doing?

00:42.917 --> 00:45.045
I told you that
I'm willing to risk it all,

00:46.004 --> 00:47.797
and that the two of us are
in this together.

00:49.174 --> 00:51.259
I will keep going even if it kills me.

00:51.342 --> 00:52.594
And you should do the same as well.

00:53.511 --> 00:55.805
I think it's better
if you stick to your confession,

00:57.390 --> 00:58.641
and keep loving me to death.

01:13.239 --> 01:15.575
Mu-deok, those eyes,
don't look at me like that.

01:16.076 --> 01:17.619
You told me that you'd love me to death,

01:17.702 --> 01:19.287
but I'm sure
they'll see the lie with those eyes.

01:20.455 --> 01:21.539
Then, young master.

01:22.040 --> 01:26.044
How is a girl who loves a boy to death
supposed to look at him then?

01:27.045 --> 01:28.880
Well, first of all…

01:29.631 --> 01:32.509
uh, glaring at me
like that will definitely not do.

01:33.802 --> 01:36.179
They say one's eyes should be
brimming with sweetness.

01:38.598 --> 01:39.808
That's too much, right?

01:40.517 --> 01:42.977
Ugh, why did you even
have to say it in the first place?

01:43.061 --> 01:46.356
If you'd told them you had mild feelings,
it would have been easier.

01:47.982 --> 01:50.360
Say that I try to
look at you with sweetness,

01:50.443 --> 01:52.570
and keep loving you to death.

01:52.654 --> 01:54.739
What will become of Mu-deok from now on?

01:54.823 --> 01:56.116
From now on?

01:56.199 --> 01:59.077
Wow. So you want me to
carry on without a plan

01:59.160 --> 02:01.955
when Maidservant Kim is trying
so hard to marry you off?

02:03.665 --> 02:06.084
What do you think
will happen to Mu-deok, then?

02:06.876 --> 02:10.046
Oh, do not worry, your young master won't
get married just yet.

02:10.130 --> 02:11.339
"Not just yet"?

02:11.881 --> 02:13.299
You didn't want to drink
the chaste herb tea

02:13.383 --> 02:14.467
so you could get married.

02:17.178 --> 02:20.265
So, Mu-deok, are you telling me…

02:20.348 --> 02:23.351
you want some kind of a promise
of a future for us or something?

02:23.434 --> 02:25.228
If I am to keep on loving you,

02:26.479 --> 02:28.857
of course, I need to be certain
that you are mine.

02:31.109 --> 02:35.071
Do you not think this is something
that should be decided so hastily?

02:35.155 --> 02:36.072
So you're refusing?

02:37.991 --> 02:40.869
I mean, why do you always
have to be so… dramatic?

02:40.952 --> 02:43.496
I'm just saying
I cannot do it right now, right here.

02:43.580 --> 02:46.583
Maidservant Kim… I need to
talk to Maidservant Kim first, too.

02:46.666 --> 02:48.501
Unbelievable.

02:48.585 --> 02:49.419
Forget it!

02:50.503 --> 02:52.213
"Eyes brimming with sweetness,"
yeah, right.

02:52.297 --> 02:54.883
I'll look at you like a dog
barking up the wrong tree.

02:54.966 --> 02:56.050
A dog?

02:57.051 --> 02:58.011
Oh, right. Dog!

02:58.094 --> 02:59.721
I've been forgetting
about something important.

02:59.804 --> 03:01.556
Master, this isn't the time to argue.

03:02.182 --> 03:03.975
The dog that time was the dog.

03:04.559 --> 03:06.102
What nonsense are you barking about?

03:06.186 --> 03:09.022
The dog Master Lee had back there
in Danhyanggok. Do you remember?

03:10.190 --> 03:11.274
That Sapsali?

03:11.357 --> 03:12.692
Yes, that dog…

03:13.902 --> 03:15.069
was Gwigu.

03:18.114 --> 03:19.657
Master Lee has always known

03:20.283 --> 03:22.285
that you're actually a soul shifter
from the beginning.

03:22.785 --> 03:23.703
He might…

03:24.871 --> 03:26.664
even know that you are Naksu.

03:40.220 --> 03:43.806
What brings Jinyowon's leader
to Songrim at this time of the day?

03:49.312 --> 03:51.022
I guess she must be here for you.

03:52.023 --> 03:53.149
I heard

03:53.233 --> 03:56.694
that you took our relic, Gwigu,
into the royal palace today.

03:56.778 --> 03:59.572
It was to find traces
of sorcery in the royal palace.

03:59.656 --> 04:04.160
I warned you not to involve Jinyowon
in any cases related to the soul shifters.

04:04.244 --> 04:06.412
Why is Songrim using Jinyowon at will?

04:08.706 --> 04:10.625
The mage families
of the Unanimous Assembly

04:10.708 --> 04:12.377
must strive to stop sorcery.

04:12.460 --> 04:16.256
If Songrim is striving to do just that,
it's obvious for Jinyowon to offer

04:16.923 --> 04:18.508
their assistance, is it not?

04:18.591 --> 04:22.178
What is obvious is that
you intend to use us again.

04:22.262 --> 04:25.139
In that case, I will take Gwigu with me.

04:26.391 --> 04:28.268
Don't make a fuss and hand over Gwigu.

04:28.351 --> 04:32.021
Or should I try to look for it myself?

04:32.730 --> 04:34.232
Gwigu is right here.

04:44.659 --> 04:47.870
Gwigu is a precious relic
created by Master Seo Gyeong.

04:47.954 --> 04:49.539
So, it also belongs to Songrim.

04:49.622 --> 04:51.916
You dare suggest that our relic
belongs to Songrim?

04:52.000 --> 04:55.628
Are you saying that Jinyowon is just
some kind of storehouse for others?

04:55.712 --> 04:57.463
That is not what he meant at all.

04:57.547 --> 04:58.756
So that's why you're so shameless.

04:58.840 --> 05:01.384
Because you think
everything in Jinyowon is Songrim's.

05:01.467 --> 05:03.594
It seems that Songrim mages

05:04.178 --> 05:05.972
love to just take things without asking.

05:08.474 --> 05:12.103
You have said
something similar before as well.

05:13.813 --> 05:18.026
That there was a Songrim mage
who had taken something from Jinyowon.

05:25.533 --> 05:26.993
Who was that person?

05:38.171 --> 05:40.965
Over there. I'm looking right at him.

05:42.008 --> 05:44.635
The man who snuck into
Jinyowon like a thief

05:44.719 --> 05:46.387
and stole Gwigu from us.

05:47.472 --> 05:51.267
How dare you!
You dare call Master Lee a thief!

05:51.351 --> 05:52.852
If taking what belongs to others

05:52.935 --> 05:55.313
without permission is not thievery,
then what is?

05:55.396 --> 05:57.732
Mother, please, calm yourself.

05:57.815 --> 06:01.903
But the person who moved it
from the broken pottery into the body

06:01.986 --> 06:03.696
of that dog was Master Lee.

06:03.780 --> 06:05.615
It was Songrim that broke it.

06:05.698 --> 06:06.866
How dare you!

07:08.594 --> 07:10.304
It is dead, master.

07:14.308 --> 07:15.768
I was protecting my daughter.

07:15.852 --> 07:19.230
Master Lee, did you give Gwigu
an order to attack us just now?

07:19.313 --> 07:21.899
Gwigu attacked because it sensed sorcery.

07:26.070 --> 07:27.363
So, that means she…

07:29.198 --> 07:31.159
has traces of sorcery.

07:39.333 --> 07:42.670
It must have sensed the sorcery
of the worm that sucked her blood.

07:49.010 --> 07:50.094
Young Lady Jin.

07:51.179 --> 07:52.180
Have you…

07:52.972 --> 07:54.640
ever performed sorcery?

08:00.855 --> 08:03.065
Did you say sorcery?
That is complete nonsense!

08:03.149 --> 08:06.819
Then, why would Gwigu try to attack her?

08:07.403 --> 08:10.448
Songrim must be trying
to frame my daughter right now.

08:10.531 --> 08:12.033
Everyone, please, stop!

08:12.700 --> 08:14.452
Master Lee is absolutely right.

08:18.039 --> 08:19.248
The truth is…

08:20.041 --> 08:23.586
not too long ago, I did use sorcery.

08:25.713 --> 08:26.589
Huh.

08:29.675 --> 08:33.304
But it wasn't anything
malicious to hurt anyone.

08:41.604 --> 08:43.648
It's quite popular these days.

08:45.107 --> 08:48.611
It's a Lovers' Charm
that helps one's love.

08:54.659 --> 08:56.577
I think it may have been because of this.

09:04.085 --> 09:07.171
It seems our daughter has caused
a misunderstanding.

09:07.255 --> 09:08.339
Our apologies.

09:32.113 --> 09:35.908
You stayed alive
in the body of this once-dead dog,

09:36.826 --> 09:38.869
but now all your energy is gone.

09:47.295 --> 09:50.715
Gwigu… has now completely vanished.

09:52.717 --> 09:54.051
What do we do?

09:54.885 --> 09:58.598
So, is it all my fault that Gwigu died?

09:58.681 --> 09:59.557
Jin Cho-yeon!

10:00.308 --> 10:02.685
How dare you disgrace Jinyowon?

10:27.168 --> 10:28.377
Gwigu is dead?

10:29.545 --> 10:30.588
Yes.

10:30.671 --> 10:33.507
Master Lee said he will bury it
in the daylight tomorrow.

10:35.009 --> 10:36.761
So this dog was Gwigu.

10:40.306 --> 10:43.851
It must have known that I was
a soul shifter from the moment it saw me.

10:43.934 --> 10:46.020
But it never barked at me after that.

10:47.772 --> 10:50.358
Was it covering for me, too?

10:55.279 --> 10:56.906
Even though it is dead, it is still Gwigu.

10:57.907 --> 11:00.618
It's dangerous if its power remains.
Do not touch it.

11:08.918 --> 11:11.379
The people from Jinyowon,
did they just leave?

11:11.462 --> 11:13.089
They are discussing
another issue right now.

11:13.798 --> 11:14.674
Another issue?

11:15.299 --> 11:16.842
It turns out Dang-gu and Cho-yeon

11:17.927 --> 11:19.136
were in a relationship.

11:20.471 --> 11:21.305
- What?
- What?

11:22.682 --> 11:25.976
I was the one who destroyed
a relic of Jinyowon,

11:26.060 --> 11:27.937
so no harm was done to Songrim.

11:28.521 --> 11:30.439
Now that we are done, we shall get going.

11:31.565 --> 11:32.692
Let's go.

11:32.775 --> 11:35.027
- Yes.
- Uh, Wait, Lady Jin.

11:35.111 --> 11:37.363
At least, have some tea before you leave.

11:37.446 --> 11:40.741
We should clear misunderstandings
and make meaningful bonds.

11:40.825 --> 11:41.992
Make bonds?

11:42.076 --> 11:44.036
These two are in love,
are they not?

11:44.120 --> 11:46.497
The charm that you took out before

11:46.580 --> 11:49.208
was for your relationship
with Dang-gu, was it not?

11:51.585 --> 11:53.838
Right. It's all because of me.

11:54.422 --> 11:56.173
Cho-yeon hasn't done anything wrong.

11:56.257 --> 11:57.258
Don't get involved.

11:59.969 --> 12:01.595
I, too, learned of this recently.

12:01.679 --> 12:03.472
He was talking nonsense about how

12:03.556 --> 12:05.850
they could be together
if your late daughter returns,

12:06.392 --> 12:08.144
so I made sure
to reprimand him personally.

12:08.227 --> 12:11.272
My late daughter? Bu-yeon is alive
and we will find her soon.

12:12.732 --> 12:15.359
Do you truly believe
that Jin Mu will find Bu-yeon?

12:15.985 --> 12:18.863
He is undoubtedly playing you
for a fool right now, Lady Jin.

12:19.447 --> 12:21.824
Was it also Jin Mu
who gave you the idea to search

12:21.907 --> 12:23.743
Songrim for Gwigu at this hour?

12:23.826 --> 12:26.036
Please, don't meddle
in Jinyowon's affairs.

12:26.620 --> 12:29.457
Now, let us not fight. All right?

12:29.540 --> 12:32.668
Will it not be wonderful news
if Lady Jin finds her daughter?

12:32.752 --> 12:37.423
And Lady Jin, what good can come out
of making enemies with Songrim? Huh?

12:37.506 --> 12:40.843
Be cordial as we were like before.

12:40.926 --> 12:42.344
Who knows, hmm?

12:42.428 --> 12:46.056
Cho-yeon and Dang-gu may unite
the two families together.

12:46.140 --> 12:47.475
I may have to decline.

12:47.558 --> 12:50.269
Cho-yeon will definitely have
a better suitor.

12:51.771 --> 12:55.691
Come now. Who is better than
the Park family of Songrim? Gosh!

12:55.775 --> 12:57.318
A daughter of my family

12:57.401 --> 13:00.154
is good enough to be
the bride of the Crown Prince.

13:01.697 --> 13:04.325
Mother, what are you
talking about right now?

13:05.284 --> 13:06.494
I do not want to.

13:07.286 --> 13:08.954
The Crown Prince is unkind.

13:09.455 --> 13:11.916
- I don't like him at all.
- Jin Cho-yeon.

13:12.666 --> 13:14.543
I'm going to get married
to someone I love.

13:16.086 --> 13:16.921
Yes.

13:17.546 --> 13:19.465
And I am that someone she loves.

13:19.548 --> 13:20.591
Park Dang-gu!

13:26.514 --> 13:28.265
We will talk about this at home.

13:31.060 --> 13:32.770
Let go of his hand this instant.

13:34.855 --> 13:36.565
Let her go for now.

13:36.649 --> 13:38.484
Put down her hand and let her go.

13:39.777 --> 13:41.320
Let go of that hand.

13:41.403 --> 13:42.488
Let go!

13:51.664 --> 13:52.623
Cho-yeon.

13:52.706 --> 13:55.626
If you are going to do what you wish,
do not even bother coming home.

13:59.296 --> 14:00.130
Uh…

14:04.677 --> 14:07.596
I think it will be better
that we leave for now.

14:08.180 --> 14:09.014
Mm.

14:10.391 --> 14:11.934
Will you really not come with us?

14:12.017 --> 14:14.270
I will not do what Mother wants this time.

14:15.813 --> 14:17.273
Please, understand me.

14:19.733 --> 14:22.444
Once your mother has calmed down,
I will send word.

14:24.738 --> 14:26.031
Please take care of her for now.

14:26.866 --> 14:27.700
I will.

14:37.209 --> 14:39.920
Sorry, Uncle, I apologize for the trouble.

14:40.004 --> 14:41.589
But I have to protect my lady.

14:41.672 --> 14:43.674
You get out now!

14:52.766 --> 14:55.561
Where should we stay tonight, Dang-gu?

14:58.022 --> 14:59.189
I don't know.

15:02.776 --> 15:06.739
Since he told us to leave, I suppose,
for now, we could go to an inn

15:06.822 --> 15:07.740
and get a room--

15:08.449 --> 15:10.284
- Get a room, you said?
- Sorry?

15:11.952 --> 15:13.829
Oh! No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

15:13.913 --> 15:16.040
Not one room, but separate rooms.

15:20.002 --> 15:22.379
I really don't want to stay
in such a place.

15:24.131 --> 15:27.051
But there's nowhere else
we can go at this time of night.

15:27.134 --> 15:28.636
And it's getting cold…

15:29.386 --> 15:30.387
It's cold.

15:32.932 --> 15:34.224
Where can we go?

15:34.308 --> 15:35.434
Young Master Park!

15:37.102 --> 15:40.439
They said Young Master Jang just got out,
but he's not in his room.

15:40.522 --> 15:41.690
Have you seen him around?

15:46.779 --> 15:48.781
Is there something wrong with you two?

15:50.616 --> 15:51.825
Oh. Goodness.

15:51.909 --> 15:53.994
- Maidservant Kim…
- What…

15:54.078 --> 15:55.079
Maidservant Kim.

15:55.162 --> 15:56.872
You're scaring me.

15:57.831 --> 16:00.376
Gosh, even you, Young Lady Jin?
What is going on?

16:00.459 --> 16:02.086
Maidservant Kim…

16:02.169 --> 16:04.630
The relic Gwigu,
which caused mayhem at the palace,

16:04.713 --> 16:08.425
was destroyed by Lady Jin
as she was trying to retrieve it.

16:08.509 --> 16:10.260
Gwigu was really destroyed?

16:10.344 --> 16:12.221
How could she destroy
a treasure that detects sorcery?

16:12.304 --> 16:14.682
Detecting sorcery is just an excuse.

16:14.765 --> 16:18.310
It was a relic that Songrim used
to threaten the royal family.

16:18.394 --> 16:19.937
Jin Mu is right.

16:20.020 --> 16:23.565
Songrim wanted to prove they were
more powerful than the royal family.

16:24.858 --> 16:26.735
By pretending to root out sorcery,

16:26.819 --> 16:28.737
they can sway the Unanimous Assembly

16:29.405 --> 16:31.365
to possibly dethrone the king.

16:32.074 --> 16:34.326
Is that why they mentioned
the King's Star?

16:34.410 --> 16:37.454
To threaten me by saying
a new king could potentially emerge?

16:38.747 --> 16:41.250
The reason Master Lee mentioned
the King's Star was to explain

16:41.333 --> 16:42.710
somebody like Master Seo Gyeong

16:42.793 --> 16:44.878
will eventually come and save
the people from the chaos.

16:44.962 --> 16:46.839
It was not to threaten the royal family.

16:46.922 --> 16:50.217
If the one that saves the world
wants to rule it as the next king,

16:51.093 --> 16:52.469
do you think you can stop that?

16:54.054 --> 16:55.639
Gwanju Jang Gang

16:55.723 --> 16:58.017
prophesied that
the King's Star would appear.

16:58.100 --> 16:59.518
Master Lee said that as well.

17:01.020 --> 17:03.897
Does Songrim know
about this prophecy, too?

17:11.363 --> 17:14.241
He tried to bear a son
with the energy of the King's Star

17:14.324 --> 17:15.951
from his many concubines.

17:16.035 --> 17:18.620
And now my father is even trying
to find one at Songrim.

17:19.329 --> 17:21.623
It's only natural
for the King to be afraid.

17:22.791 --> 17:24.293
In the eyes of the royal family,

17:24.376 --> 17:27.504
the existence of a King's Star
could be considered treason.

17:34.720 --> 17:35.721
"Treason"?

17:36.930 --> 17:39.475
The people of Daeho do worship
and believe in the heavens,

17:40.100 --> 17:42.811
but the centuries-old monarchy
will not crumble so easily.

17:42.895 --> 17:45.564
It is preposterous to think
that one can become king

17:45.647 --> 17:46.982
for some constellation.

17:47.066 --> 17:49.777
If that person is from Songrim,
it is possible.

17:50.944 --> 17:53.906
Master Seo Gyeong of Songrim
saved the world a long time ago.

17:54.531 --> 17:58.786
But he is still very much
revered within Daeho.

18:00.245 --> 18:02.915
If someone was born under the King's Star
like Master Seo Gyeong,

18:02.998 --> 18:07.669
it could serve as a very convincing reason
to become the King.

18:09.546 --> 18:10.798
So you really think

18:12.007 --> 18:15.135
the King's fears may come true then?

18:17.679 --> 18:19.098
Do not be concerned.

18:19.973 --> 18:24.603
As long as I'm protecting the palace,
the royal family will be fine.

18:29.525 --> 18:30.609
Very well.

18:30.692 --> 18:35.114
I will not be foolish like my father
and live my whole life in constant fear.

18:39.660 --> 18:41.662
When I brought Gwigu to the palace,

18:42.704 --> 18:44.623
I saw as you predicted,

18:44.706 --> 18:47.960
that the Queen is someone who uses sorcery
and one of Jin Mu's people.

18:48.043 --> 18:52.005
But we can't provoke
the royal family just yet.

18:52.089 --> 18:54.424
If Songrim tries
to go after the royal family,

18:54.508 --> 18:57.553
Jin Mu will use
the circumstances of Uk's birth

18:57.636 --> 19:00.013
and turn him into
the enemy of the royal family.

19:00.764 --> 19:04.226
Then Songrim will become
an enemy of the royal family as well

19:04.309 --> 19:05.394
for taking him in.

19:06.353 --> 19:07.813
Jang Gang must come.

19:09.148 --> 19:11.567
Since Jang Gang actually knows
the whole truth,

19:12.192 --> 19:14.611
he must know Jin Mu's weakness as well.

19:14.695 --> 19:17.739
How will you find someone
who has been wandering aimlessly

19:17.823 --> 19:19.074
for decades?

19:19.700 --> 19:21.869
We'll have to hope
he will return on his own.

19:23.203 --> 19:27.124
The rumors about soul shifters
have spread throughout Daeho Fortress.

19:27.207 --> 19:30.294
If he hears those rumors,
surely he'll return,

19:30.377 --> 19:35.215
in fear for Songrim and for his son,
Jang Uk, who was left here.

20:13.962 --> 20:15.672
I came because I was summoned.

20:15.756 --> 20:16.882
Where is Master Lee?

20:19.218 --> 20:21.303
He left for Danhyanggok at dawn

20:21.929 --> 20:23.388
and went to bury Sapsali.

20:23.972 --> 20:24.890
What?

20:25.474 --> 20:28.435
He is not here? Was it not Master Lee
who summoned me?

20:28.518 --> 20:29.519
He did summon you.

20:31.730 --> 20:33.523
He told me to give you this.

20:36.235 --> 20:40.489
This is the assassin Naksu's sword
that he retrieved from the Crown Prince.

20:41.657 --> 20:44.159
He said you are the only one
who can keep this sword

20:44.243 --> 20:45.494
and told me to give it to you.

20:46.995 --> 20:48.497
He just left me this sword?

20:48.580 --> 20:51.124
Did he-- did he say
anything else before leaving?

20:51.208 --> 20:55.128
He did not. I do not understand
what makes him so fond of you

20:55.212 --> 20:58.340
when he has no intention
to take you in as his pupil.

20:58.423 --> 21:01.593
From what I can see,
you will not even practice chastity.

21:02.928 --> 21:06.265
I heard from Park Jin that
you are head over heels for a woman.

21:06.890 --> 21:08.600
If you were in love with Mu-deok,

21:08.684 --> 21:10.435
why did you lead on my Yun-ok?

21:11.937 --> 21:14.314
- I swear that I never led her on.
- What nonsense!

21:14.398 --> 21:15.732
You charmed Yun-ok.

21:15.816 --> 21:18.694
And how did you manage
to charm my Master Lee?

21:18.777 --> 21:20.028
I did not do anything.

21:20.112 --> 21:23.615
Accusing me of charming people like that,
just because they are being nice to me…

21:23.699 --> 21:25.826
Master Heo, I think that's unfair of you.

21:27.119 --> 21:30.163
You need to be careful
with Yun-ok's feelings

21:30.247 --> 21:31.873
and be respectful to Master Lee.

21:31.957 --> 21:32.958
Yes.

21:33.041 --> 21:36.670
Master Lee is not as close-minded
as all the other masters at Songrim.

21:36.753 --> 21:39.923
And he seems to be
open-minded and quite gracious.

21:40.007 --> 21:41.425
I certainly do have
a lot of respect for him.

21:42.426 --> 21:46.388
I can see you have no idea
how strict he can be, hmm?

21:46.471 --> 21:50.642
He knows how to be merciless towards those
who stray away from the right path.

21:50.726 --> 21:53.478
So you must learn to be careful.

21:53.562 --> 21:54.396
Go ahead.

22:01.153 --> 22:02.821
Oh, I forgot.

22:02.904 --> 22:04.489
I almost screwed up.

22:04.573 --> 22:09.244
There was a message he wanted me
to pass on as he gave Naksu's sword to me.

22:21.298 --> 22:23.216
Why would Master Lee give you my sword?

22:23.925 --> 22:26.011
He probably wants me
to hold on to your sword

22:26.887 --> 22:28.722
since I have you, Naksu, by my side.

22:29.639 --> 22:32.267
I guess that means he'll continue
to leave us alone as always.

22:32.768 --> 22:33.602
That is good.

22:39.566 --> 22:42.194
There was a message
he wanted me to pass on.

22:47.157 --> 22:49.534
Tell him that he must keep the sword safe.

22:49.618 --> 22:52.120
And then if anyone ever tries
to use the sword,

22:52.204 --> 22:53.497
he must kill them at once.

22:55.624 --> 22:57.751
If he fails to follow through…

22:59.711 --> 23:01.546
then he is going to die as well.

23:04.758 --> 23:05.717
It was a warning

23:06.301 --> 23:09.221
that he will not let us live
if Mu-deok ever uses that sword

23:09.721 --> 23:11.056
as the assassin Naksu.

23:15.602 --> 23:17.771
The sword feels strange,
even though it's mine.

23:19.064 --> 23:21.650
He must have let me live
because he knows I can't use it.

23:22.734 --> 23:25.237
It means you will be safe
if you stay as Mu-deok.

23:26.113 --> 23:28.407
It means if I become Naksu,
I'll be in danger.

23:29.449 --> 23:31.743
Once I find the ice stone
and regain my power,

23:32.411 --> 23:34.371
I will also gain a lot of enemies again.

23:36.373 --> 23:37.874
What happens to me then

23:38.500 --> 23:40.001
will have nothing to do with you.

23:40.085 --> 23:40.919
Why?

23:41.753 --> 23:43.922
Because we'll no longer be
master and pupil?

23:44.005 --> 23:45.799
You'll no longer have to protect me.

23:46.425 --> 23:48.510
Nor will I have a reason
to go easy on you.

23:49.970 --> 23:52.180
Because that was our promise
from the very beginning.

24:00.021 --> 24:01.398
Then promise me one more thing.

24:02.149 --> 24:04.359
With all the duty and loyalty
that we have built up,

24:04.443 --> 24:07.112
and now as two people
who love each other to death,

24:07.195 --> 24:08.572
you can grant me one more wish, right?

24:10.115 --> 24:11.908
Fine. What is it?

24:12.617 --> 24:13.994
When you regain your energy,

24:14.786 --> 24:17.289
if you must draw that sword
and point it at someone,

24:18.415 --> 24:20.167
point it at me before anyone else.

24:23.211 --> 24:24.129
You stab me,

24:24.880 --> 24:27.424
and I'll take responsibility
for setting Naksu upon the world,

24:28.258 --> 24:29.259
and I will die.

24:33.430 --> 24:34.556
If you don't,

24:35.682 --> 24:37.809
well, at that time,
I'll make you another promise.

24:39.561 --> 24:40.687
The assurances

24:41.521 --> 24:43.440
that you really wanted to hear
from your young master

24:43.523 --> 24:45.817
about our future, you know.

24:54.367 --> 24:57.537
For now, I will look for the ice stone
so you do not run wild…

24:58.997 --> 25:00.582
because I promised you that as well.

25:11.760 --> 25:13.345
The runaway couple, my lord,

25:14.513 --> 25:15.972
is staying at our house right now.

25:17.807 --> 25:20.060
Dang-gu is there with Cho-yeon?

25:21.144 --> 25:22.020
Mm.

25:22.604 --> 25:26.733
Why did you take them in, Maid Kim?

25:26.816 --> 25:27.984
Well, then,

25:28.068 --> 25:29.903
should I have left them to go into town

25:29.986 --> 25:33.406
to build a lover's nest
and become the talk of the town?

25:35.367 --> 25:36.660
- Hmm.
- I ask you

25:36.743 --> 25:39.829
to keep an eye on them
and take care of them.

25:39.913 --> 25:42.332
They're a sweet couple.
And those two look good together.

25:42.415 --> 25:44.167
Why are you so against it?

25:44.251 --> 25:46.503
The two of them can't be together.

25:46.586 --> 25:48.380
So you're gonna
kick them out just like that?

25:48.964 --> 25:51.466
My lord, you must stop this right now.

25:52.008 --> 25:55.387
The other night, too, you held Mu-deok
and Young Master Jang for no reason.

25:55.470 --> 25:57.681
You must become
more tolerant as you get older.

25:58.265 --> 26:00.225
Goodness me.

26:01.268 --> 26:03.353
I like Mu-deok a lot.

26:03.436 --> 26:05.814
I truly like Young Master Jang.

26:07.274 --> 26:08.191
Maid Kim.

26:08.942 --> 26:11.403
What would you do if Uk falls in love

26:12.779 --> 26:15.574
with a woman he should not be with,

26:16.241 --> 26:17.200
like Dang-gu?

26:17.284 --> 26:19.286
Could you really be tolerant?

26:20.954 --> 26:21.955
Hmm…

26:23.832 --> 26:27.377
As long as Young Master Jang loves her,
I am not against it.

26:27.460 --> 26:29.212
- Are you sure?
- Of course.

26:32.132 --> 26:33.174
I'm sure you will.

26:33.800 --> 26:35.885
I know that you care about their family,

26:35.969 --> 26:38.930
their appearance, their age,
and everything like that.

26:39.014 --> 26:40.599
The most important is
what the heart wants.

26:41.182 --> 26:44.102
If you are in love,
appearances do not matter at all.

26:44.978 --> 26:46.730
Even if she's not that beautiful,

26:47.314 --> 26:49.691
or they do have
a really big difference in age.

26:50.775 --> 26:51.610
Hmm.

26:56.031 --> 26:59.326
Is that how you feel right now, too?

27:00.785 --> 27:01.661
Maid Kim?

27:01.745 --> 27:02.912
Pardon?

27:06.291 --> 27:09.753
So, anyone who isn't
as handsome as Jang Gang

27:10.754 --> 27:12.297
and is much older

27:12.380 --> 27:15.592
would still have a chance…

27:17.385 --> 27:18.762
if your heart is moved?

27:20.513 --> 27:21.348
Well…

27:22.390 --> 27:23.224
Hmm…

27:25.060 --> 27:26.436
If my heart is moved…

27:28.355 --> 27:31.191
he'd be more handsome
and seem younger to me.

27:31.274 --> 27:32.567
Something like that.

27:45.664 --> 27:48.083
I understand what you mean by that…

27:49.584 --> 27:50.627
Maidservant Kim.

27:59.678 --> 28:00.804
Ooh.

28:08.353 --> 28:13.233
Goodness gracious! How could he be
so bold in asking my true feelings?

28:14.734 --> 28:16.444
Why is he saying not handsome?

28:16.945 --> 28:18.947
He's only two years older than me.

28:22.117 --> 28:23.702
He worries for no reason.

28:27.956 --> 28:29.332
Hmm.

28:34.462 --> 28:38.591
How can Maid Kim say
that she likes Master Lee

28:38.675 --> 28:40.677
so easily in front of me?

28:44.472 --> 28:46.182
Is he really that handsome?

28:48.143 --> 28:51.688
He's more than a hundred years older, too.

29:01.990 --> 29:03.032
Park Dang-gu.

29:03.825 --> 29:05.410
You little brat!

29:09.539 --> 29:10.832
In times like these,

29:12.250 --> 29:16.004
I wish I could have some of the wine
Uncle always tries to hide in his cabinet…

29:17.172 --> 29:18.423
instead of tea.

29:18.506 --> 29:20.967
What? You already have regrets?

29:21.551 --> 29:22.594
Not at all.

29:23.261 --> 29:26.598
I believed in my heart
that I could really give up everything.

29:26.681 --> 29:29.350
That's the reason
why I took her hand that day.

29:31.686 --> 29:34.981
I didn't know he would
grab my hand so suddenly like that.

29:35.732 --> 29:38.651
I was just upset that
they talked about the Crown Prince.

29:38.735 --> 29:40.737
Then I just said that I don't like him.

29:41.780 --> 29:44.157
But then he grabbed my hand
and said he loved me.

29:44.240 --> 29:45.492
Please, move over a bit.

29:48.536 --> 29:50.705
I couldn't just let go of his hand.

29:50.789 --> 29:52.874
I mean I was simply
swept up in the moment.

29:53.792 --> 29:56.461
I never thought of
running away with him like this.

29:58.129 --> 29:59.756
How long will you be here for?

30:01.299 --> 30:03.802
Maidservant Kim told me
to serve you two while you are here.

30:06.054 --> 30:07.514
I don't know.

30:07.597 --> 30:09.682
I don't want to stay here for that long.

30:10.725 --> 30:13.853
We are here like this,
but if I say we should go back home,

30:13.937 --> 30:16.105
I would seem like
a very irresponsible man, right?

30:16.189 --> 30:19.108
If I say I want to go home,
would it break his heart?

30:20.151 --> 30:21.820
What do I do?

30:23.530 --> 30:24.697
This is for the best.

30:25.198 --> 30:27.242
Serving Young Lady Cho-yeon here

30:27.325 --> 30:29.702
is better than
running into Park Jin at Songrim.

30:29.786 --> 30:31.538
If So-i is the one responsible

30:32.080 --> 30:34.332
for the recent murder
that you are being suspected of,

30:34.916 --> 30:36.042
it's dangerous.

30:36.125 --> 30:39.838
Because you do not know her,
but she does know Mu-deok.

30:41.756 --> 30:44.717
Why is that girl, So-i,
going around killing people?

30:48.596 --> 30:50.765
If the blind girl
who these men were picking on

30:50.849 --> 30:52.684
is the same girl as So-i,

30:53.226 --> 30:54.978
then she couldn't
have killed them herself.

30:55.061 --> 30:56.563
Someone must have helped her.

30:56.646 --> 30:59.858
If the authorities take these bodies,
they will catch the culprit.

31:00.692 --> 31:02.318
Mu-deok would know about So-i.

31:02.402 --> 31:04.654
We should send her to the authorities
and have her questioned.

31:05.864 --> 31:07.574
There's no way
she will recognize So-i,

31:07.657 --> 31:10.118
because she's not the Mu-deok
who lived in Sari Village.

31:10.201 --> 31:13.121
She was falsely accused
and has already suffered with this matter.

31:13.204 --> 31:16.082
If necessary, I will go
and ask her for myself.

31:21.963 --> 31:23.089
Hmm.

31:23.172 --> 31:26.426
I don't think you need to step up.
Yul seems already to be on top of it.

31:33.850 --> 31:35.518
We will be in trouble
if the Assistant Gwanju

31:35.602 --> 31:37.061
hears of you walking about like this.

31:37.145 --> 31:39.606
We killed everyone who could recognize me.

31:39.689 --> 31:42.233
And I'd walk about
even after I got into Jinyowon.

31:42.317 --> 31:44.444
So I should practice
walking like the blind.

31:45.570 --> 31:47.030
You should buy what you want.

31:47.113 --> 31:49.032
I gave you quite a bit of money.

31:50.575 --> 31:52.160
Still, we should return soon.

31:53.912 --> 31:54.746
But…

31:55.622 --> 31:57.874
why are you using an umbrella
instead of a cane?

31:59.876 --> 32:01.044
Don't touch it.

32:03.046 --> 32:04.422
I like this a lot.

32:16.392 --> 32:19.270
Anyway, since you did help
prove my innocence,

32:19.354 --> 32:21.648
I hope you will be comfortable
while you are here.

32:21.731 --> 32:23.900
Does the Jang family always eat like this?

32:24.609 --> 32:26.444
Hmm, it's too greasy.

32:29.781 --> 32:32.700
Yes, my lady.
I will prepare a different meal.

32:41.960 --> 32:43.711
Ugh, salty! It's too salty!

32:46.130 --> 32:48.091
- It is not salty.
- It is.

32:48.174 --> 32:50.385
My face gets puffy if it's salty.

32:53.096 --> 32:54.347
I understand, my lady.

32:56.557 --> 32:58.476
This is way too hard to eat.

32:58.559 --> 33:00.395
Oh, no.

33:01.604 --> 33:02.897
What is this thing?

33:04.148 --> 33:05.692
I think I've lost my appetite.

33:07.986 --> 33:11.239
What kind of girl is she?
Why is she acting exactly like Uk?

33:11.948 --> 33:13.241
I'm not hungry.

33:13.324 --> 33:14.826
Do you have something to drink?

33:14.909 --> 33:16.244
Like cinnamon or rice punch?

33:22.083 --> 33:24.585
They are perfect for each other.
Why did they call it off?

33:24.669 --> 33:25.586
If they had gotten married,

33:25.670 --> 33:28.131
one of them definitely
would have died in a fight.

33:32.969 --> 33:34.137
Mu-deok, the rice punch is--

33:34.220 --> 33:36.889
Sweet, right? And it's too cold for you?

33:36.973 --> 33:39.726
Rice punch is supposed
to be like that, okay?

33:39.809 --> 33:41.477
Why are you getting mad at me?

33:41.561 --> 33:43.104
Are you tired of serving me?

33:43.187 --> 33:46.149
Well, you try it out then.

33:48.568 --> 33:50.820
It's because I get agitated
when I'm anxious.

33:50.903 --> 33:52.864
How can I relax in someone else's home?

33:52.947 --> 33:54.741
Then why don't you just go home?

33:55.783 --> 33:58.536
No way. I'm too scared to go back.

33:58.619 --> 34:00.580
Mother is extremely angry.

34:02.123 --> 34:05.460
Your own mother,
she must truly despise you.

34:05.543 --> 34:07.462
I was never my mother's favorite.

34:08.629 --> 34:10.798
Because I was lacking
compared to my sister.

34:12.675 --> 34:14.677
Even though she was blind,

34:14.761 --> 34:16.763
she could see energy and handle relics.

34:16.846 --> 34:19.599
Even as a child, her abilities
were on par with my mother's.

34:19.682 --> 34:21.893
Well, I've heard the Jin family members

34:21.976 --> 34:25.396
have stronger divine powers
than spell-related powers.

34:25.980 --> 34:28.149
You saw me handle Gwigu, right?

34:28.816 --> 34:29.734
It's like that.

34:30.443 --> 34:32.153
A really powerful priestess

34:32.236 --> 34:35.740
can control people's souls
and render them helpless by trapping them.

34:36.699 --> 34:38.993
- Did you say trapping a soul?
- Mm-hmm.

34:39.077 --> 34:41.120
If the priestess traps their powers,

34:41.204 --> 34:43.956
even the most powerful mage is helpless.

34:46.709 --> 34:49.045
Well, I have heard
there are shamans who can

34:49.128 --> 34:51.297
erase or change memories of a soul.

34:51.380 --> 34:53.716
A Jinyowon priestess
is in a different league.

34:54.217 --> 34:57.303
How did such an amazing girl like her
get into such an accident?

34:58.846 --> 35:00.264
Because she's amazing.

35:02.225 --> 35:04.102
She's definitely alive.

35:05.937 --> 35:07.563
We will see her again.

35:13.861 --> 35:15.238
If Bu-yeon is alive,

35:16.197 --> 35:17.615
I'm sure you will soon.

35:26.457 --> 35:29.418
Uncle looked into Mu-deok
to find out who she is.

35:30.002 --> 35:31.254
He asked the broker about her.

35:31.963 --> 35:32.922
Did you know that?

35:33.798 --> 35:36.968
Yes. Mu-deok told me. Yes.

35:37.051 --> 35:39.971
He's even more suspicious
since the soul shifter case.

35:40.555 --> 35:41.472
It makes sense.

35:41.556 --> 35:43.391
If there are actually
soul shifters in the palace,

35:43.474 --> 35:45.643
who knows if they are in Songrim, too?

35:46.727 --> 35:50.565
Park Dang-gu, why is the cast-out
successor worrying about it?

35:50.648 --> 35:52.400
I have not been cast out.

35:53.317 --> 35:55.486
- He already regrets it.
- You--

35:55.570 --> 35:58.114
You were so confident yesterday
when you left. Goodness!

36:00.449 --> 36:02.076
Uk is the one that always gets kicked out.

36:02.160 --> 36:03.578
What is happening with me?

36:03.661 --> 36:05.413
It's nothing once you get used to it.

36:05.913 --> 36:09.083
But it's… miserable the first time, huh?

36:10.710 --> 36:12.753
Yul, you have no idea how we feel, right?

36:12.837 --> 36:13.880
What do you mean?

36:13.963 --> 36:15.047
Yul's been kicked out once, too.

36:15.131 --> 36:16.215
What? Yul?

36:16.924 --> 36:19.093
Do you not remember
that time I broke the gold-plated inkstone

36:19.177 --> 36:20.678
and we all decided to lie together?

36:25.808 --> 36:29.187
Uncle Jin is going to be so angry with me.

36:29.270 --> 36:30.646
Let us hide it.

36:31.606 --> 36:34.275
We'll bury it in the ground
and pretend to know nothing about it.

36:34.358 --> 36:35.484
That is not the right thing.

36:36.319 --> 36:38.613
We must tell the truth
and ask for forgiveness.

36:38.696 --> 36:41.782
Then Dang-gu will get into
a lot of trouble with the leader.

36:44.827 --> 36:47.246
You know I cannot tell a lie.

36:48.372 --> 36:50.124
Do not cry, Dang-gu.

36:51.000 --> 36:52.627
I'm sure there is a way.

36:54.837 --> 36:57.840
Eventually, the three of us
agreed to cover it up.

36:58.591 --> 37:01.010
But Yul became very ill afterward.

37:01.594 --> 37:04.555
I think Yul is very ill right now.

37:04.639 --> 37:05.848
I think so, too.

37:08.100 --> 37:12.104
My goodness,
why is our Yul so sick? What is wrong?

37:12.688 --> 37:16.984
I heard he cannot eat
or sleep well lately. Huh?

37:18.736 --> 37:21.405
Yul was the golden child
who had never done anything wrong.

37:21.906 --> 37:23.866
Just how worried was he that he fell ill?

37:25.117 --> 37:28.496
So, that's why we ended up confessing
because we thought Yul would die.

37:28.579 --> 37:30.706
So we were all kicked out together.

37:30.790 --> 37:34.085
I've been kicked out so many times
that I do not remember it exactly.

37:34.168 --> 37:37.713
But if it's Yul, I doubt he was sick
because of his fear of being caught.

37:39.131 --> 37:41.842
I think it's because
he suffered so much from

37:42.510 --> 37:44.720
having to do something bad
that he already knew

37:44.804 --> 37:45.721
was completely wrong.

37:50.017 --> 37:52.186
He can't even find his way
when he is surprised?

37:53.896 --> 37:56.899
He must have been so worried
and scared about doing something

37:57.650 --> 37:59.151
he knew for certain was wrong

38:00.736 --> 38:02.113
in order to protect his friends.

38:07.368 --> 38:09.829
You are right. I remember it clearly.

38:11.205 --> 38:12.581
It was quite painful.

38:13.666 --> 38:15.543
The punishment you gave yourself is

38:15.626 --> 38:18.546
harsher than what
others would actually lay upon you.

38:18.629 --> 38:20.798
Is it some sort of
a heightened state of morality?

38:21.507 --> 38:23.718
Gosh, you were already
like that at that age?

38:24.427 --> 38:25.469
You sure are something.

38:27.138 --> 38:29.890
Can you imagine how I felt
burying that inkstone

38:29.974 --> 38:31.392
with my immature friends, huh?

38:32.768 --> 38:35.229
And we got caught soon after
because we didn't bury it well.

38:35.313 --> 38:36.605
- What?
- Hmm?

38:36.689 --> 38:39.400
We were caught? You said we confessed.

38:39.984 --> 38:41.569
Dang-gu is remembering it wrong.

38:42.069 --> 38:43.487
We did not confess to it.

38:44.530 --> 38:47.950
We were caught because
Sang-ho found the half-buried inkstone.

38:48.576 --> 38:49.410
Is that right?

38:50.286 --> 38:51.787
Oh, did I romanticize the memory?

38:53.164 --> 38:55.458
I thought this story
had an honorable ending.

38:55.541 --> 38:57.126
Gosh, that's embarrassing.

38:57.209 --> 39:00.004
Embarrassing?
What are you embarrassed about?

39:00.087 --> 39:01.589
You have run away from home.

39:02.340 --> 39:05.051
Who will be the next leader
instead of Dang-gu?

39:06.302 --> 39:07.219
Will it be Sang-ho?

39:07.303 --> 39:08.679
Oh, do you think so?

39:08.763 --> 39:11.140
I should get on his good side.
I'd better get close to him.

39:12.141 --> 39:14.268
Hey! You two cannot discard me like this.

39:14.352 --> 39:16.270
You should take my side like back then.

39:16.354 --> 39:18.230
Come on, Uk. Uk!

39:18.314 --> 39:20.858
Having me on your side will not
be much help to you, anyway.

39:21.609 --> 39:24.653
- Hey, Yul.
- I'm not good with words, either.

39:25.154 --> 39:26.364
Especially about love.

39:34.955 --> 39:36.165
You're on my side.

39:54.934 --> 39:57.603
Yul, you haven't been
sleeping well these days, have you?

39:57.686 --> 40:00.231
Drink as much as you want today

40:00.773 --> 40:02.775
and get a good night's sleep.

40:04.110 --> 40:06.112
Why? You're having trouble?

40:06.737 --> 40:07.738
I'm fine.

40:07.822 --> 40:09.407
I saw you wandering around late at night.

40:09.490 --> 40:11.283
You usually go to bed on the dot.

40:11.367 --> 40:14.912
Is it because you're concerned
about going back to Seoho Fortress?

40:21.961 --> 40:24.380
I just cut down a soul shifter.

40:25.798 --> 40:27.883
Protecting this world from such monsters

40:28.926 --> 40:30.136
is our duty.

40:32.012 --> 40:33.931
Even though it is dead, it is still Gwigu.

40:34.473 --> 40:37.059
It's dangerous if its power remains.
Do not touch it.

40:44.692 --> 40:46.652
You are feigning ignorance, right?

40:50.114 --> 40:51.949
Like the time we buried the inkstone.

40:53.409 --> 40:56.412
Hey, Yul. It must be tough for you.

41:14.638 --> 41:17.433
If I regain my energy
and draw this sword,

41:18.893 --> 41:22.771
will I be able to slash
anyone relentlessly like before?

41:27.735 --> 41:29.487
That's the assassin's sword, right?

41:31.071 --> 41:32.990
Why did young master bring it back again?

41:34.533 --> 41:37.870
That sword… terrifies me a bit.

41:38.871 --> 41:40.789
It feels ominous. I don't want it here.

41:43.417 --> 41:46.378
The guests are all asleep.
So you should get to bed, too.

41:47.046 --> 41:48.672
Maybe we need to have a charm written.

41:58.974 --> 42:00.100
Terrifying…

42:03.270 --> 42:04.313
and ominous.

42:34.843 --> 42:36.929
Eunuch Kim
who caused trouble at Cheonbugwan,

42:37.012 --> 42:38.764
is not beside the Queen today, either.

42:39.723 --> 42:41.100
Did you look into it?

42:41.183 --> 42:44.436
They say he's ill and is resting, sire,
but no one knows where he is.

42:46.230 --> 42:48.440
Find out as much as you can about him.

42:48.524 --> 42:50.025
Find out when he came to the palace,

42:50.109 --> 42:53.153
when he started serving the Queen,
and if there is anything odd about him.

42:53.988 --> 42:55.239
Be discrete, Eunuch Oh.

42:56.115 --> 42:57.032
Yes, Your Highness.

43:03.080 --> 43:06.542
Do you remember what Eunuch Kim said
when we saw him back there at Cheonbugwan?

43:08.794 --> 43:10.963
Did that wench Shaman Choi

43:11.630 --> 43:13.549
order you to kill me?

43:14.133 --> 43:15.843
So, Shaman Choi…

43:15.926 --> 43:19.013
she must be superior to Jin Mu
to have ordered him.

43:20.055 --> 43:21.348
It must be the Queen.

43:21.849 --> 43:24.560
Just as Mu-deok's true identity is Naksu,

43:24.643 --> 43:26.103
could the true identity of the Queen…

43:27.354 --> 43:29.064
really be Shaman Choi?

43:29.148 --> 43:30.024
You might be right.

43:31.442 --> 43:34.320
If the Queen… is a soul shifter.

43:35.404 --> 43:39.366
There was no evidence to suspect
Her Highness the Queen is a soul shifter.

43:39.450 --> 43:42.453
I checked her core of energy
as I was examining her,

43:42.536 --> 43:45.456
but she was a normal person
without notable energy.

43:47.750 --> 43:51.962
She could have appeared that way
if she had the ice stone with her.

43:52.671 --> 43:53.922
Hmm.

43:54.006 --> 43:57.718
The Queen is really the younger sister
of General Seo, isn't that right?

43:57.801 --> 43:59.219
She's Yul's aunt.

43:59.303 --> 44:02.890
She's not related to the Heo family,
but she is a member of the Seo family.

44:02.973 --> 44:04.475
If her soul is shifted,

44:05.434 --> 44:09.271
the soul in the Queen's body now
is someone else.

44:09.355 --> 44:12.524
Then, does that mean
the soul of the Queen is dead?

44:13.108 --> 44:14.568
That's not possible.

44:14.652 --> 44:18.280
Each member of the Seo Family
has a personal Lantern of Life, you see.

44:19.239 --> 44:22.785
Because they guard the Seoho Fortress
near the border and go to battle often,

44:22.868 --> 44:26.705
they each have a lantern that is lit
by the energy of their soul

44:26.789 --> 44:28.457
so they know who is alive and dead.

44:29.625 --> 44:31.835
If the Queen had passed away,

44:32.336 --> 44:35.506
they would know immediately
because her lantern would have gone out.

44:36.298 --> 44:38.967
That's right, the Lantern of Life.

44:39.051 --> 44:43.138
They would have moved her soul
and kept it alive.

44:44.848 --> 44:47.267
Just like Master Kang of Daegangtongun

44:48.394 --> 44:50.354
who is lying in Sejukwon right now.

44:52.731 --> 44:57.111
Then, are you certain
that the Queen is really a soul shifter?

44:58.696 --> 45:00.364
If we can know that for sure,

45:01.365 --> 45:04.868
that would mean
we found Jin Mu's greatest weakness.

45:08.038 --> 45:10.249
Songrim is suspicious of me.

45:10.332 --> 45:13.293
They will try to prove
that the Queen's a soul shifter.

45:13.377 --> 45:14.920
What is there to worry about?

45:15.963 --> 45:19.091
We already have a body here
for you to transfer your soul.

45:24.471 --> 45:28.392
Getting that body into Jinyowon
should not be a problem, right?

45:29.643 --> 45:31.437
I will bring her to Jinyowon today.

45:32.020 --> 45:34.273
If everything goes according to plan,

45:34.857 --> 45:37.401
Jinyowon will finally
get their lost daughter back,

45:38.068 --> 45:40.571
and there will soon be
a funeral at the palace.

45:42.614 --> 45:45.826
Because Her Majesty,
the Queen will have passed away.

45:48.537 --> 45:53.167
What should we do
with my body the Queen's soul is in?

45:55.294 --> 45:58.046
We should take care of it
since we no longer need it alive.

46:41.048 --> 46:43.801
Your Highness, I've come here today
in place of Eunuch Kim.

46:52.643 --> 46:53.769
It's such a pity.

46:54.728 --> 46:58.607
I really think it would be
better for you to let go of your mind.

47:20.671 --> 47:22.172
Huh, this must be Gaema Village.

47:23.173 --> 47:24.842
You are looking for a shaman?

47:25.342 --> 47:26.218
Mm-hmm.

47:27.177 --> 47:29.054
Then try going to Gaema Village.

47:29.847 --> 47:32.558
All kinds of shamans gather there
all the time.

47:33.559 --> 47:36.144
And I happen to be on good terms
with the oldest of them all.

47:36.728 --> 47:39.523
If you are looking for someone,
you will find him there.

47:42.943 --> 47:44.319
Come on, Fire Priestess is really--

47:44.403 --> 47:46.446
- No, thank you.
- Oh, goodness.

47:46.530 --> 47:48.156
Uh, excuse me.

47:48.240 --> 47:50.534
Do you know where Shaman Bong's house is?

47:50.617 --> 47:54.288
Shaman Bong? Gosh!
He doesn't have powers anymore.

47:54.371 --> 47:56.039
You should go to
the Fire Priestess instead.

47:56.123 --> 47:58.834
- I will take you there.
- No, I-- I'm looking for Shaman Bong.

47:58.917 --> 48:02.588
- I told you, he is not good.
- No, it has to be Shaman Bong. I'm sorry.

48:02.671 --> 48:03.797
Thank you.

48:16.101 --> 48:17.895
Ugh, where am I?

48:18.604 --> 48:20.689
All of the streets look the same to me.

48:20.772 --> 48:21.690
Ugh!

48:24.443 --> 48:27.404
This is ridiculous! When did I say
I wanted to see the Fire Priestess?

48:27.487 --> 48:31.199
But if you had your fortune read,
you still have to pay, sir!

48:31.283 --> 48:33.160
- Oh? Let go!
- Gosh! Oh…

48:33.243 --> 48:35.704
She did not get
a single thing right. Why should I pay?

48:40.626 --> 48:41.793
Ah!

48:41.877 --> 48:43.670
Did you go and see Shaman Bong?

48:43.754 --> 48:45.005
Not very good, is he?

48:45.088 --> 48:48.091
The Fire Priestess
is the real deal, right?

48:48.175 --> 48:49.801
Fire Priestess! What Fire Priestess?

48:49.885 --> 48:50.969
Uh, come on.

48:53.972 --> 48:54.806
Enough!

48:56.183 --> 48:58.769
Did you come
to have your fortune read?

48:58.852 --> 49:00.854
What about you?
Are you here for an exorcism?

49:02.064 --> 49:04.733
What did the Fire Priestess say
to make you so angry?

49:05.484 --> 49:08.946
She said I have no luck in government
and that I should get into business

49:09.029 --> 49:10.989
when I'm the Crown Prince.

49:11.865 --> 49:13.575
What did Shaman Bong say to you?

49:13.659 --> 49:15.994
I am on my way to see him.
I have many questions for him.

49:18.914 --> 49:19.831
Jang Uk.

49:23.085 --> 49:25.212
Are you perhaps also here for Eunuch Kim?

49:28.757 --> 49:30.384
Why are you looking for him here?

49:34.137 --> 49:37.432
Since that day at Cheonbugwan,
he has disappeared from the palace.

49:38.266 --> 49:40.227
His traces led me to this place.

49:40.310 --> 49:43.647
Wait, so you came all the way here
alone without any guards?

49:45.482 --> 49:47.275
Because I did not want anyone to notice

49:48.235 --> 49:49.861
that I am suspicious of him.

49:53.115 --> 49:55.033
So you are suspicious because Eunuch Kim

49:56.118 --> 49:58.996
is a soul shifter
and the Queen is trying to cover it up?

50:01.081 --> 50:01.999
Right.

50:03.208 --> 50:05.002
Why are you here?
What are you looking for?

50:05.836 --> 50:08.672
I think there are overlaps
in what we are looking for.

50:08.755 --> 50:10.674
Shall we exchange information?

50:10.757 --> 50:12.759
Share one piece of information each?

50:12.843 --> 50:14.845
Fine. You go first then.

50:14.928 --> 50:16.847
No way. Come on now. If I tell you first,

50:16.930 --> 50:19.641
you'll say, "I am the Crown Prince,"
and not bother to tell me yours.

50:19.725 --> 50:20.684
You don't know that for sure.

50:22.352 --> 50:23.603
All right. Fine.

50:25.230 --> 50:28.442
I was searching for Eunuch Kim,
and I found something strange.

50:28.942 --> 50:31.486
They say that he left the palace
every month to go somewhere.

50:32.362 --> 50:34.322
And that is this place, Gaema Village.

50:35.407 --> 50:37.576
The person I'm looking for is Shaman Choi.

50:38.160 --> 50:39.077
Shaman who?

50:39.161 --> 50:41.621
That is for the next exchange.
So, goodbye then.

50:42.456 --> 50:43.665
Hey, hey, hey. Wait. Hold on.

50:44.750 --> 50:47.878
What can I get from "I'm looking for
Shaman Choi," with no context?

50:47.961 --> 50:49.713
I do not know much about it, either.

50:52.549 --> 50:55.552
- Why are you following me now?
- To meet Shaman Bong.

50:55.635 --> 50:57.262
We don't have to go together
at the same time.

50:57.345 --> 51:00.682
I can just go afterward
and get him to tell me what he told you.

51:01.349 --> 51:02.476
Because I'm the Crown Prince.

51:03.935 --> 51:05.479
Hmm.

51:07.773 --> 51:09.524
I do not know where he is, either.

51:09.608 --> 51:10.942
I know you do.

51:11.026 --> 51:12.360
I really have no idea.

51:15.405 --> 51:20.452
I have met with both of your families
on the behalf of you two.

51:20.535 --> 51:21.828
What did she say?

51:22.537 --> 51:24.790
Is she still very angry at me?

51:25.665 --> 51:27.709
Is my uncle really going to cast me out?

51:29.002 --> 51:31.546
They said they will be able
to forgive you both

51:31.630 --> 51:33.256
if you can submit a signed letter.

51:33.340 --> 51:36.176
An official letter swearing
never to see each other again.

51:39.554 --> 51:40.388
Here.

51:42.724 --> 51:44.101
Everything is already written,

51:44.184 --> 51:46.394
so, all you have to do is sign each copy

51:46.478 --> 51:47.521
so you can go home.

51:48.814 --> 51:50.565
You can discuss
before making your decision.

51:51.399 --> 51:56.571
As for me, I am willing to provide
food and shelter for a while

51:56.655 --> 51:58.448
if you insist on staying together.

51:58.532 --> 51:59.991
Please, excuse me.

52:10.794 --> 52:11.670
Cho-yeon…

52:17.050 --> 52:18.051
to tell you the truth…

52:21.555 --> 52:23.306
I slightly regretted it.

52:26.059 --> 52:28.145
I was also scared that I may have acted…

52:30.647 --> 52:32.107
rather impulsively.

52:35.986 --> 52:36.862
But…

52:43.493 --> 52:45.328
…when I think of never seeing you again…

52:48.748 --> 52:50.500
I don't care about anything else.

52:52.544 --> 52:54.254
I cannot sign this letter.

52:54.337 --> 52:56.006
I cannot live without seeing you.

52:58.300 --> 53:00.427
JIN CHO-YEON OF JINYOWON SWEARS NEVER
TO SEE PARK DANG-GU OF SONGRIM AGAIN

53:01.303 --> 53:03.471
I was also annoyed at first.

53:06.516 --> 53:08.226
But I want to keep seeing you.

53:44.721 --> 53:46.389
The negotiation is off.

53:46.890 --> 53:49.559
Mu-deok, please, go set the table now.

53:56.107 --> 53:57.150
Have some fish.

54:02.781 --> 54:03.615
Here.

54:04.366 --> 54:05.408
Have some meat as well.

54:18.004 --> 54:22.092
Are you two really
going to be staying here?

54:22.175 --> 54:23.009
Mm-hmm.

54:23.510 --> 54:26.888
We are both going to go home
and bring our belongings here, too.

54:26.972 --> 54:30.392
Wait! So you intend
to live here full-time?

54:32.143 --> 54:34.062
It's not like that,

54:34.771 --> 54:36.439
but we at least need a change of clothes.

54:36.523 --> 54:37.941
Mu-deok, could you go
with Cho-yeon, please,

54:38.024 --> 54:39.442
and help her carry all her luggage back?

54:50.245 --> 54:51.955
Did you throw away the paper
that was here?

54:52.539 --> 54:53.373
I was about to.

55:00.672 --> 55:01.589
JIN CHO-YEON OF JINYOWON SWEARS NEVER
TO SEE PARK DANG-GU OF SONGRIM AGAIN

55:01.673 --> 55:03.300
I need to think it over again.

55:04.467 --> 55:07.721
If I pack up my things and leave,
I might really get kicked out.

55:09.806 --> 55:11.141
Did you get hurt?

55:13.393 --> 55:14.311
Does it hurt?

55:15.145 --> 55:16.521
Of course, it does.

55:20.317 --> 55:21.192
Oh.

55:21.901 --> 55:22.861
You have a scar.

55:22.944 --> 55:24.487
How did you get that?

55:25.238 --> 55:26.072
I don't know.

55:26.698 --> 55:28.658
It was when I was young. I don't remember.

55:29.659 --> 55:31.619
That's a scar from a laceration.

55:31.703 --> 55:34.873
My sister had one
in the same place because of me.

55:36.166 --> 55:38.835
She fell exactly like you did just now.

55:46.885 --> 55:49.179
A scar has formed on the cut.

55:53.183 --> 55:54.225
Oh.

55:54.309 --> 55:55.643
This will definitely do.

55:57.645 --> 56:00.732
I will try to do my best, Father.

56:03.360 --> 56:05.111
Don't call me that unless it's needed.

56:06.488 --> 56:07.530
It disgusts me.

56:18.500 --> 56:19.959
Did he have to be so rude about it?

56:20.668 --> 56:23.171
Why did he throw away
such a beautiful silk handkerchief?

56:25.423 --> 56:26.424
Wait.

56:34.557 --> 56:36.851
It has the same design as Mu-deok's.

56:41.398 --> 56:43.650
- Did the lord from Jinyowon leave?
- Yes.

56:46.820 --> 56:48.321
What is this design?

56:48.405 --> 56:51.866
It is the crest of the Jin family
of Jinyowon, which you will join soon.

56:51.950 --> 56:54.035
You will go there today. Get ready.

56:54.744 --> 56:55.578
Right.

56:58.665 --> 57:00.208
Is that what this was?

57:09.050 --> 57:10.927
Why would Mu-deok have something

57:11.761 --> 57:13.805
with the crest of Jinyowon on it?

57:21.646 --> 57:24.149
You have to get my things
without my mother finding out.

57:24.232 --> 57:25.066
Follow me.

57:26.568 --> 57:28.903
I wish she would just stay
since we are already at her house.

57:37.245 --> 57:40.165
How can we believe this guy?
He seems like a hack.

57:40.999 --> 57:43.334
Well, let's see. I heard
that he is something.

57:43.418 --> 57:47.255
You are both piping hot.
You have shared something.

57:47.922 --> 57:49.007
Are you two lovers?

57:52.760 --> 57:54.679
Ah.

57:54.762 --> 57:57.974
It is my business policy
never to breach confidentiality.

57:58.057 --> 57:59.642
So you can rest assured.

57:59.726 --> 58:04.564
But the two of you have already shared
something very meaningful, right?

58:06.065 --> 58:06.941
He is good.

58:08.401 --> 58:09.235
Ugh.

58:11.905 --> 58:15.158
I heard you are the one who has been
living in Gaema Village the longest.

58:15.241 --> 58:16.743
Do you happen to know Shaman Choi?

58:20.038 --> 58:21.289
Shaman Choi, you say?

58:21.372 --> 58:24.292
Are you mages patrolling
the town for sorcery?

58:27.670 --> 58:30.089
Oh, no. It's nothing like that. No!

58:30.173 --> 58:33.468
I only wanted to find her
because I heard she was good.

58:36.596 --> 58:38.598
Oh, yes, she was.

58:39.182 --> 58:40.975
Over 20 years ago.

58:47.982 --> 58:49.859
Shaman Choi was famous

58:49.943 --> 58:53.446
for her sorcery that put hexes on people.

58:54.489 --> 58:56.449
Then one day, she got caught

58:56.533 --> 59:00.411
by Cheonbugwan mages
who were cracking down on sorcery.

59:01.329 --> 59:02.872
But she jumped into a fire.

59:04.999 --> 59:08.461
Some say she died in that fire.

59:09.337 --> 59:13.925
And others say she was burnt badly
but survived and ran away.

59:14.008 --> 59:14.968
That was when

59:15.051 --> 59:17.929
your father Jang Gang was the Gwanju
of Cheonbugwan, was it not?

59:20.848 --> 59:23.977
If Shaman Choi was hunted
by the mages of Cheonbugwan back then,

59:25.103 --> 59:27.397
are you seeking her because
she bears a grudge against your father?

59:27.480 --> 59:29.816
I do not even remember
what my father looks like.

59:30.400 --> 59:32.860
So how can I know
who bears a grudge against him?

59:36.239 --> 59:39.284
PARK DANG-GU OF SONGRIM SWEARS NEVER
TO SEE JIN CHO-YEON OF JINYOWON AGAIN

59:41.411 --> 59:43.663
Dang-gu, you did not sign the paper.

59:43.746 --> 59:45.873
I thought about signing the paper
and coming back home…

59:47.208 --> 59:49.294
but then I thought
that would just be lying.

59:49.377 --> 59:51.337
Because I cannot live without seeing her.

59:54.632 --> 59:56.843
These feelings did not blossom overnight.

59:57.969 --> 01:00:01.055
I was in love with her, sir,
for a really long time, you know.

01:00:01.139 --> 01:00:03.725
But I could not express it
and could only take her hand just now.

01:00:03.808 --> 01:00:05.226
So don't call us childish,

01:00:05.310 --> 01:00:07.854
and please, give us a chance, Uncle.

01:00:07.937 --> 01:00:10.231
Take your bundle of belongings

01:00:10.315 --> 01:00:11.941
and go to Uk's home now.

01:00:12.942 --> 01:00:14.652
- Uncle, please, don't--
- There is…

01:00:15.653 --> 01:00:17.113
something you must do there.

01:00:26.831 --> 01:00:28.750
If this person comes to his house,

01:00:28.833 --> 01:00:30.501
let me know immediately.

01:00:30.585 --> 01:00:32.629
Who is… who is this?

01:00:33.796 --> 01:00:35.632
Cheonbugwan's Gwanju, Jang Gang.

01:00:36.382 --> 01:00:37.634
He is Uk's father.

01:00:41.262 --> 01:00:42.263
If he comes…

01:00:44.807 --> 01:00:45.767
let me know…

01:00:47.143 --> 01:00:48.019
right away.

01:00:50.980 --> 01:00:52.857
Oh, wait, I forgot.

01:00:52.940 --> 01:00:56.486
Shaman Choi actually had
a younger brother.

01:00:57.445 --> 01:01:00.239
Do you perhaps know
where we might find him?

01:01:00.323 --> 01:01:04.327
I have not seen him in Gaema Village
since the incident, either.

01:01:05.036 --> 01:01:08.373
But there used to be a rumor going around

01:01:08.456 --> 01:01:10.917
that he married a woman
from a powerful family.

01:01:35.650 --> 01:01:38.653
I heard the girl you're bringing
this time is most likely her.

01:01:39.529 --> 01:01:41.364
Why is she wearing those rags, though?

01:01:41.447 --> 01:01:43.908
She almost drowned
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho once.

01:01:43.991 --> 01:01:46.661
She was barely alive
when the fishermen rescued her.

01:01:47.578 --> 01:01:51.249
Perhaps having almost died
has caused her to lose all her memories,

01:01:51.332 --> 01:01:54.085
but she can sense things around her
as though she can really see,

01:01:54.877 --> 01:01:56.337
even though she is blind.

01:02:19.360 --> 01:02:22.363
You really do have the birthmark here.

01:02:31.330 --> 01:02:33.082
And you have a scar in the same place.

01:02:34.417 --> 01:02:37.628
So that was why
he said that you are likely

01:02:38.838 --> 01:02:39.756
to be Bu-yeon.

01:02:39.839 --> 01:02:40.673
However,

01:02:41.549 --> 01:02:42.884
it could still be a coincidence.

01:02:42.967 --> 01:02:45.636
So why not give her the test
with the surest and only method?

01:02:52.560 --> 01:02:54.729
Let's go and see if you can open…

01:02:56.355 --> 01:02:57.398
Jinyowon.

01:03:07.825 --> 01:03:09.494
The Cheonbugwan people are here again.

01:03:09.994 --> 01:03:12.288
They must have brought
another girl to see if she is Bu-yeon.

01:03:22.340 --> 01:03:25.218
Since you have
Jin Cho-yeon's blood in your body,

01:03:25.843 --> 01:03:28.387
you should be able to
move the doors of Jinyowon.

01:03:30.348 --> 01:03:32.934
All you have to do is
move the doors even a little bit.

01:03:33.518 --> 01:03:34.727
That should be enough.

01:03:45.238 --> 01:03:47.281
Dozens have already been here before,

01:03:48.449 --> 01:03:50.493
but none of the girls
could open that door.

01:04:33.327 --> 01:04:34.245
Oh, Bu-yeon!

01:04:35.788 --> 01:04:36.789
Bu-yeon!

01:04:40.418 --> 01:04:41.460
It is happening again.

01:04:41.961 --> 01:04:44.505
Why does this happens
every time I come to Jinyowon?

01:05:00.354 --> 01:05:01.898
If it was 20 years ago,

01:05:02.440 --> 01:05:04.567
it was when Jin Mu
was your father's pupil.

01:05:06.402 --> 01:05:08.237
Jin Mu may know something.
Should I ask him?

01:05:08.779 --> 01:05:09.906
Absolutely not.

01:05:10.573 --> 01:05:14.243
Please keep what you heard today
just between you and me, please.

01:05:15.995 --> 01:05:19.123
Well, what we learned today
doesn't seem important, but I will.

01:05:22.835 --> 01:05:26.088
Your Highness, you said
you came here alone, did you not?

01:05:26.172 --> 01:05:27.131
I did.

01:05:27.214 --> 01:05:30.343
But it seems like someone has been
following us for a while now, right?

01:05:34.138 --> 01:05:37.308
Shall we split up here, then?
To see who they are following?

01:05:38.267 --> 01:05:39.101
Mm.

01:06:17.515 --> 01:06:18.641
Mother!

01:07:00.725 --> 01:07:02.727
Who are you and why are you following me?

01:07:05.771 --> 01:07:06.689
Who are you?

01:07:10.109 --> 01:07:11.235
Tell me.

01:08:04.246 --> 01:08:06.999
The Jin Bu-yeon
that Jin Mu has found is really So-i.

01:08:07.083 --> 01:08:08.292
Why is it in this room though?

01:08:08.375 --> 01:08:09.794
Mu-deok is the real daughter.

01:08:09.877 --> 01:08:11.837
What will become of me
if she finds that out?

01:08:11.921 --> 01:08:13.255
Jin Mu has a card in his hand

01:08:13.339 --> 01:08:15.883
so big that even if
Jin Ho-gyeong finds out,

01:08:15.966 --> 01:08:17.176
she then can do nothing.

01:08:17.760 --> 01:08:18.803
What do you want?

01:08:18.886 --> 01:08:21.138
You, the head of Jinyowon,
must fight Songrim

01:08:21.222 --> 01:08:23.390
so that we can all protect the ice stone.

01:08:24.725 --> 01:08:26.644
Everyone, please, settle down!

01:08:26.727 --> 01:08:29.772
Do you mean you wish to become
a hero with the fate of the King's Star

01:08:29.855 --> 01:08:31.524
by destroying every ice stone then?

01:08:31.607 --> 01:08:32.900
Is Seo Yul among them?

01:08:32.983 --> 01:08:35.236
I'm going to kill him first.

01:08:35.319 --> 01:08:36.153
Young Master!

01:08:38.030 --> 01:08:38.989
There's a soul shifter.

01:08:39.073 --> 01:08:40.366
Uk is going to die!

01:08:40.449 --> 01:08:42.451
Jang Uk, my pupil…
